{"id":"f66dca8adb2ce568","group":"17","path":"17/17-thm-completeness-characterization.md","title":"Characterization of Completeness","display":"thm-completeness-characterization — Characterization of Completeness","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-thm-completeness-characterization","aliases":["17-thm-completeness-characterization"],"display":"thm-completeness-characterization — Characterization of Completeness","depends_on":["[[17-df-theory-properties]]","[[17-df-elementary-equivalence]]","[[17-df-model]]"],"source_section":"1.4","source_result":"completeness convention, direct semantic consequence","source_pages_print":[37],"source_pages_djvu":[53],"source_verification":"statement-compared; local equivalent formulation","label_origin":"local-catalog","legacy_label":"17-thm-1.4.4"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-thm-completeness-characterization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-thm-completeness-characterization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-completeness-characterization — Characterization of Completeness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bd7acd1192e46962\" href=\"?note=bd7acd1192e46962\" title=\"17-df-theory-properties\">17-df-theory-properties</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bdfdb62527f9710d\" href=\"?note=bdfdb62527f9710d\" title=\"17-df-elementary-equivalence\">17-df-elementary-equivalence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"1.4"},{"key":"source_result","html":"completeness convention, direct semantic consequence"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>37</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>53</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; local equivalent formulation"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-1.4.4"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-theory, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bd7acd1192e46962\" href=\"?note=bd7acd1192e46962\" title=\"17-df-theory-properties\">17-df-theory-properties</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Complete}\">\\(\\operatorname{Complete}\\)</span> (semantic completeness predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bd7acd1192e46962\" href=\"?note=bd7acd1192e46962\" title=\"17-df-theory-properties\">17-df-theory-properties</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\)</span> (model class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_L\">\\(\\equiv_L\\)</span> (elementary-equivalence relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"bdfdb62527f9710d\" href=\"?note=bdfdb62527f9710d\" title=\"17-df-elementary-equivalence\">17-df-elementary-equivalence</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\n\\to\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Complete}(T)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl[\n\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\n\\forall\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n(\\mathfrak A\\equiv_L\\mathfrak B)\n\\bigr]\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\n\\to\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Complete}(T)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl[\n\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\n\\forall\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n(\\mathfrak A\\equiv_L\\mathfrak B)\n\\bigr]\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The nonempty-model clause is required because <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Complete}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Complete}(T)\\)</span> includes semantic consistency.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-theory-properties","status":"resolved","id":"bd7acd1192e46962","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-theory-properties]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"bdfdb62527f9710d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-elementary-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-theory-properties","status":"resolved","id":"bd7acd1192e46962","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ ($L$-theory, see [[17-df-theory-properties]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-theory-properties","status":"resolved","id":"bd7acd1192e46962","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Complete}$ (sema